# FR-1108's release signing configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `keystore.properties` — which is git-ignored — and fill it in. The build
# reads it if it exists and ignores it if it does not, so a clone with no keystore still builds
# everything except a signed release (NFR-503: "reproducible from a clean checkout").
#
# **This file is committed and holds no values.** `keystore.properties` is not committed and
# holds the passwords for the upload key, which cannot be removed from a history once they are
# in one.
#
# Creating the keystore is a step only you can take, and `docs/RELEASE.md` has the command.
# Whoever holds this key holds the ability to publish updates to the app; losing it means the
# app can never be updated again under the same listing unless Play App Signing is enrolled.

storeFile=/absolute/path/to/latch-upload.jks
storePassword=
keyAlias=latch-upload
keyPassword=
